# Requests of the API for the VS Code REST Client against the dev host: one per action and an error case each
# The host and later the key come from tools/.env, which git ignores: SLAED_API_HOST=http://slaed.loc and SLAED_API_KEY=SLAED_<prefix>.<secret>

@host = {{$dotenv SLAED_API_HOST}}
@base = {{host}}/api/v1

### system/ping - 200, the empty success of the envelope
GET {{base}}/system/ping
X-Request-Id: api-http-ping-01

### system/ping by POST - 405 no_method, Allow: GET, HEAD, OPTIONS
POST {{base}}/system/ping

### system/schema - 200, the public actions of every running service, Cache-Control: public, max-age=60
GET {{base}}/system/schema

### system/schema from a foreign origin - 403 no_scope unless the origin is on $conf['api']['cors']
GET {{base}}/system/schema
Origin: https://foreign.example

### an unknown action - 404 no_route
GET {{base}}/system/nope

### a preflight - 204 without auth
OPTIONS {{base}}/system/ping
Origin: {{host}}
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET

### master/check - 200 on slaed.net with the module master: records the site, answers manifest, keys and notes (each empty when nothing is due)
GET {{base}}/master/check?sid=0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef&v=8.0.0&ch=stable&kseq=0&php=8.4.13&db=mariadb&dbv=10.11.6&ext=3&ep=0&es=0&host=example.com

### master/check with a path as version - 422 invalid, details.param v
GET {{base}}/master/check?sid=0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef&v=../8.0.0

### master/file - 200 the full archive of a served release, Range and If-None-Match honoured
GET {{base}}/master/file?v=8.0.1&kind=full

### master/file of a release that is paused, waiting or unknown - 404 no_route
GET {{base}}/master/file?v=9.9.9&kind=delta
